1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Within the Clover's fifth leaf, there lives a devil.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Asta, born unable to harness mana, was granted the power of anti-magic from his five-leaf grimoire,

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
giving him the ability to nullify spells.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Unfortunately, the members of Spade Kingdom's Dark Triad also possessed powers from the devils of the Underworld,

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
and used them to launch an invasion on the neighboring countries.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Gaining strength from his belief in himself and from the support of his friends, Asta continues to fight for the safety of this world.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Don't flatter yourself. The key to the Underworld isn't you, per se.

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
It's a magical channel known as the Tree of Kleefoth.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Dante revealed that creating the Tree of Kleefoth would require the use of both Dark Magic and World Tree Magic.

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,000
No more chit-chat. I'm taking you down here and now.

11
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Meanwhile, all over the Heart Kingdom, the battles against Vanica's Dark Disciples raged off.

12
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
Through lightning magic, Karadus!

13
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:16,000
First, Luck defeated the skin magic user, Svengit. Next.

14
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Food magic! Glutton's Banquet!

15
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Down there!

16
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Using the Mala method to give her food magic a boost, Charmy brought down Hoglet, wielder of hair magic.

17
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:40,000
The only way to get true beauty and strength is from a balanced diet!

18
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:44,000
What? Where did that enormous array come from?

19
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,000
I endured you so that I could take my time creating it.

20
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
True flame magic.

21
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Crimson eruption!

22
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Leopold, who had obtained true flame magic thanks to the Mono method, defeated the eye magic user named Sivwar.

23
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,000
If you're not tough enough to handle getting burned, then don't play with an Inferno!

24
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Hisure and his nail magic were eliminated by the spirit guardian, Gaja.

25
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:19,000
You're finished here, Dark Disciple.

26
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Oh!

27
