105
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:48,840
Oh, boy.

106
00:06:49,220 --> 00:06:51,460
That sure was a great warm-up.

107
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:53,560
What?

108
00:06:54,060 --> 00:06:56,040
