109
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:00,740
I don't think I'll ever be able to thank you enough, Lady Vanica.

110
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:04,040
Because of you, I feel never-ending pleasure.

111
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:09,600
Shut up already.

112
00:07:10,260 --> 00:07:13,700
Take care of these annoying little bugs so I can be alone with Laura Pichka.

113
00:07:13,700 --> 00:07:28,800
I forgive you.

114
00:07:29,220 --> 00:07:31,880
Please step on me more, Lady Vanica.

115
00:07:32,380 --> 00:07:33,260
See that?

116
00:07:33,500 --> 00:07:35,340
Thanks to the curse I put on them,

117
00:07:35,340 --> 00:07:38,540
no matter how many times you kill them, they just won't die.

118
00:07:38,540 --> 00:07:47,000
Where do you think you're going?

119
00:07:47,540 --> 00:07:48,840
You're still alive?

120
00:07:50,380 --> 00:07:51,340
Of course.

121
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:54,840
We've only just begun trampling your poor little kingdom.

122
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:57,220
Long live Lady Vanica.

123
00:07:58,960 --> 00:08:00,380
So the rest of them.

124
00:08:00,380 --> 00:08:05,220
That's the power of love.

125
00:08:05,640 --> 00:08:07,700
All hail Lady Vanica.

126
00:08:07,700 --> 00:08:11,300
You little rat!

127
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:14,780
How dare you make me suffer the first pain of my life!

128
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:18,660
After I was hand-selected by Lady Vanica herself!

129
00:08:19,500 --> 00:08:21,420
I am a woman of beauty.

130
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:25,720
I should never have been put through such a disgraceful ordeal as that.

131
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:30,660
And so, with the eternal gorgeousness given to me by Lady Vanica,

132
00:08:30,840 --> 00:08:32,400
I shall destroy everything!

133
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:35,940
Why does it take them so long to do their dumb speeches?

134
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:41,340
Okay, bring our round two!

135
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:45,520
As I told you, you will be stopped.

136
00:08:46,720 --> 00:08:51,120
Sorry, but unless you defeat me, they'll keep coming back to life forever.

137
00:08:52,180 --> 00:08:55,320
And they won't lay off until your whole kingdom is dead.

138
00:08:57,980 --> 00:09:00,280
So you are ready to play!

139
00:09:00,860 --> 00:09:02,120
Took long enough.

140
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:06,480
Lord Petchka, let's go!

141
00:09:07,100 --> 00:09:07,460
Right!

142
00:09:08,260 --> 00:09:09,660
Noel, that's our cue!

143
00:09:10,140 --> 00:09:11,000
Let's do it!

144
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,080
Water creation magic!

145
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:15,380
Valkyrie armor!

146
00:09:16,500 --> 00:09:18,420
We're going to take you down!

147
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,520
Water creation magic!

148
00:09:20,880 --> 00:09:22,220
Sea dragon roar!

149
00:09:22,640 --> 00:09:24,620
Log magic, red beast!

150
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:30,760
That's your best technique?

151
00:09:30,980 --> 00:09:32,000
It's just a worm.

152
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:38,740
Just let me play with you!

153
00:09:38,820 --> 00:09:41,060
I promise it'll be lots of fun!

154
00:09:46,740 --> 00:09:52,540
I snuck in a few seeds for my magic controlling weeds when I threw that last attack at you!

155
00:09:52,540 --> 00:09:53,280
So I can't move.

156
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:57,500
But then again, neither can you!

157
00:09:57,500 --> 00:09:57,800
Mimosa!

158
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:59,280
Leave the toad to me!

159
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:03,280
You guys focus on taking down the devil-possessed one!

160
00:10:03,280 --> 00:10:04,020
The devil's the best one!

161
00:10:04,020 --> 00:10:19,820
Oh, Lady Vandica, both of your magic abilities are great!

162
00:10:19,820 --> 00:10:21,060
Curse warning and blood magic!

163
00:10:21,060 --> 00:10:25,100
It's just like Laura Petchka told us before!

164
00:10:29,100 --> 00:10:30,360
Laura Petchka!

165
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:32,080
Anyone home?

166
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:32,900
Oh yes, hello!

167
00:10:33,140 --> 00:10:33,580
I'm here!

168
00:10:34,700 --> 00:10:35,740
Apologies, everyone!

169
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:37,420
I was checking on something!

170
00:10:37,420 --> 00:10:38,160
Seriously?

171
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:42,580
Because it looked like you were spacing out!

172
00:10:43,580 --> 00:10:45,280
Now what was that about, Spade?

173
00:10:45,380 --> 00:10:46,960
Right, I was just getting to that!

174
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:52,760
Each member of the Dark Triad has a combination of two different magic attributes.

175
00:10:53,020 --> 00:10:54,920
Their own, and the one their devil has.

176
00:10:57,020 --> 00:11:02,980
When it comes to Vandica, I've fought her and Megicula before, so I will come up with a perfect strategy.

177
00:11:04,980 --> 00:11:07,000
We'll train with that in mind.

178
00:11:08,900 --> 00:11:09,960
Nice fun, Laura Petchka!

179
00:11:11,340 --> 00:11:14,920
I wonder if Dante and Xenon are having as much fun as me?

180
00:11:14,920 --> 00:11:18,760
No, whatever those two are doing, this is ten times better!

181
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,480
Because Laura Petchka's here!

182
00:11:20,620 --> 00:11:22,420
And I can kill her if I want to!

183
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:24,920
Sorry, that won't be happening today.

184
00:11:25,220 --> 00:11:26,580
Because I'm here too.

185
00:11:31,020 --> 00:11:34,560
I guess it'd be cool to have Dark Magic and World 3 Magic.

186
00:11:34,940 --> 00:11:39,520
But if you ask me, it sounds like it'd be too much of a pain to drag those two back alive!

187
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:42,260
Wait, Dark Magic?

188
00:11:42,260 --> 00:11:45,340
What do you mean by dragging them back?

189
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,620
What are you guys plotting?

190
00:11:47,020 --> 00:11:47,840
Tell me now!

191
00:11:49,220 --> 00:11:52,280
Do you honestly believe I'm going to tell you anything?

192
00:11:52,740 --> 00:11:53,180
Shh!

193
00:11:56,900 --> 00:11:58,200
World tree magic.

194
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,060
Dark magic.

195
00:12:00,060 --> 00:12:08,540
The Queen of the Heart Kingdom inherits the previous Queen's powers, as well as their knowledge and experiences.

196
00:12:09,500 --> 00:12:15,440
Here, inside Laura Petchka's mind, is where that colossal mountain of information materializes.

197
00:12:16,020 --> 00:12:20,860
It is because of this place that the Queen is called the All-Knowing Priestess.

198
00:12:20,860 --> 00:12:37,200
It's so... cruel.

199
00:12:38,200 --> 00:12:38,980
Laura Petchka!

200
00:12:38,980 --> 00:12:40,780
Listen, Noelle.

201
00:12:40,780 --> 00:12:44,780
If we let the Dark Triad have their way...

202
00:12:44,780 --> 00:12:52,660
They're going to open the door to the Underworld and release the Devils, killing more than 90% of the people on this continent.

203
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:55,460
And the world will end.

204
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,060
But that's insane!

205
00:12:57,060 --> 00:13:21,220
It's so... cruel.

206
00:13:22,220 --> 00:13:22,980
Laura Petchka!

207
00:13:22,980 --> 00:13:47,440
How can you do something like this?

208
00:13:48,220 --> 00:13:49,920
So many people will die!

209
00:13:49,920 --> 00:13:55,100
Yes, but the ones left behind will be strong and my blood will boil along with theirs.

210
00:13:55,400 --> 00:13:57,860
What's the big deal if the weaker ones die off?

211
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:02,760
Anyway, forget about the future. Let's enjoy them now!

212
00:14:03,020 --> 00:14:03,460
Enough!

213
00:14:04,140 --> 00:14:07,620
We can't allow monsters like you to roam free in this land.

214
00:14:09,820 --> 00:14:13,180
Which is why we will defeat you once and for all.

215
00:14:13,180 --> 00:14:19,560
The fate of existence itself is in our hands.

216
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:22,540
Mana zone plus mana method.

217
00:14:22,900 --> 00:14:24,440
Water spirit magic.

218
00:14:28,540 --> 00:14:30,260
Voodik sanctuary.

219
00:14:30,260 --> 00:14:39,460
With this technique, your blood magic's efficacy will be cut in half.

220
00:14:40,360 --> 00:14:43,480
Noelle's water-based attacks will increase in power.

221
00:14:46,140 --> 00:14:48,300
Stronger. I need to be stronger.

222
00:14:49,180 --> 00:14:51,040
What now?

223
00:14:51,040 --> 00:14:55,840
The lighter your armor is, the more easily you can become one with the water.

224
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:05,940
This should also help you move more fluidly.

225
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:08,320
You'll be swifter than ever before.

226
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:17,480
Valkyrie armor!

227
00:15:17,920 --> 00:15:18,880
Mermaid form!

228
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:22,460
You've destroyed so much!

229
00:15:22,740 --> 00:15:24,900
But the damage stops right here and now!

230
00:15:24,900 --> 00:15:25,900
It's...

231
00:15:25,900 --> 00:15:34,160
Well, just look at you!

232
00:15:34,500 --> 00:15:37,340
It's so cute, the little Laura Petch can't find a body!

233
00:15:38,020 --> 00:15:40,220
This will be double the fuck for me!

234
00:15:42,220 --> 00:15:44,780
Try not to die too fast!

235
00:15:46,780 --> 00:15:47,960
Devil power!

236
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,940
50% strength!

237
00:15:51,580 --> 00:15:53,700
Her blood can't harden as easily.

238
00:15:54,060 --> 00:15:55,580
But that's not slowing her down!

239
00:15:55,900 --> 00:15:56,740
I knew it!

240
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:58,700
We can't win with normal attacks!

241
00:15:59,060 --> 00:15:59,460
Noelle!

242
00:16:12,820 --> 00:16:15,240
Alright, now things are getting real!

243
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:17,160
51%!

244
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:24,440
She only went up by 1%, but she's so much stronger!

245
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:28,280
All you think about is satisfying your own twisted desires!

246
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:31,480
52%!

247
00:16:31,860 --> 00:16:34,220
You don't even think about the people you've hurt!

248
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:37,640
You killed my mother, Asir Silva, the Clover Kingdom!

249
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:39,600
53%!

250
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,960
Yeah, who's that?

251
00:16:42,160 --> 00:16:44,580
Talking about the past is pointless and boring!

252
00:16:44,940 --> 00:16:46,900
Let's enjoy the moment, shall we?

253
00:16:46,900 --> 00:16:56,600
I wish you'd give up and take your licks already, pretty girl.

254
00:16:57,160 --> 00:17:00,600
Thanks to Lady Venica, we're never gonna die, remember?

255
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:03,060
We've trained so hard.

256
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:06,540
Trust me, there's no way we'll be defeated by the likes of you!

257
00:17:07,020 --> 00:17:08,460
Not just for the world.

258
00:17:08,460 --> 00:17:12,020
Not just to avenge the death of my mother!

259
00:17:12,020 --> 00:17:26,640
You really are incredible, Lorpechka!

260
00:17:27,180 --> 00:17:29,460
With your help, our magic will be unstoppable!

261
00:17:30,300 --> 00:17:31,280
Yeah, sure.

262
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,480
I guess you had something to do with it.

263
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:34,780
Well, what did you expect?

264
00:17:35,360 --> 00:17:36,560
Lorpechka's that amazing!

265
00:17:37,300 --> 00:17:38,440
Oh no, not at all!

266
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:39,800
I'm not special!

267
00:17:39,800 --> 00:17:43,160
Forget the modesty, it comes off as fake.

268
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:50,140
But I'm only this capable because I inherited all of my abilities and mana from the queens who ruled the Heart Kingdom before me!

269
00:17:50,520 --> 00:17:53,120
Even so, your powers are unbelievably great!

270
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:55,760
They can't be inherited by just anyone, dear.

271
00:17:56,320 --> 00:18:00,160
Because I'm so clumsy and goofy, I can't help but wonder to myself sometimes,

272
00:18:00,980 --> 00:18:03,100
am I really worthy of the crown I wear?

273
00:18:03,100 --> 00:18:09,800
Last time, when I fought Vanica and the Devil Magikula, I was scared.

274
00:18:10,880 --> 00:18:13,020
And because of that, I was cursed.

275
00:18:15,100 --> 00:18:16,680
I'm unfit to be a queen.

276
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:23,500
But when I'm with you, I forget about my status and things like that.

277
00:18:24,080 --> 00:18:25,520
I feel like I can be honest.

278
00:18:26,040 --> 00:18:26,840
I wonder why.

279
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:33,080
What I'm about to tell you will probably make me seem even more undeserving.

280
00:18:35,080 --> 00:18:35,840
But...

281
00:18:35,840 --> 00:18:38,700
I'm so afraid!

282
00:18:39,420 --> 00:18:40,700
I don't want to die!

283
00:18:40,700 --> 00:18:46,280
As the queen, I'm supposed to be so much stronger and more responsible!

284
00:18:47,900 --> 00:18:48,380
I...

285
00:18:48,380 --> 00:18:51,720
I do apologize.

286
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:54,600
A queen should never cry in front of others.

287
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:56,020
Oh, come on.

288
00:18:56,300 --> 00:18:57,620
That's not true at all.

289
00:19:02,620 --> 00:19:06,220
It's okay for you to cry, especially with friends.

290
00:19:06,660 --> 00:19:07,220
Exactly.

291
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:07,400
Exactly.

292
00:19:10,700 --> 00:19:13,860
Thank you, Noelle.

293
00:19:14,660 --> 00:19:15,260
Mimosa.

294
00:19:18,400 --> 00:19:21,300
How did you trip with both of us holding you?

295
00:19:25,300 --> 00:19:29,060
No matter what, we're going to win this fight!

296
00:19:29,800 --> 00:19:31,180
For Laura Pechka!

297
00:19:31,660 --> 00:19:33,460
For our precious friend!

298
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:35,940
We're at 65%!

299
00:19:35,940 --> 00:19:37,480
66%!

300
00:19:38,000 --> 00:19:39,440
67%!

301
00:19:39,440 --> 00:19:42,940
Are you ready for the big one?

302
00:19:43,020 --> 00:19:44,360
Here we go!

303
00:19:44,980 --> 00:19:46,600
You get my best!

304
00:19:46,840 --> 00:19:47,940
Lucky you!

305
00:19:49,140 --> 00:19:51,700
Here's 78% power!

306
00:19:52,660 --> 00:19:53,780
Do it, Noelle!

307
00:19:55,840 --> 00:19:57,560
We were waiting for this.

308
00:19:57,560 --> 00:20:02,540
We need Banika to use the highest percentage of devil power that she can muster.

309
00:20:02,880 --> 00:20:06,800
As her blood magic ramps up, she'll lose more and more blood and deplete her mana.

310
00:20:07,500 --> 00:20:10,740
That's when she'll start drawing on Magikula's power to keep on fighting.

311
00:20:11,440 --> 00:20:14,260
After that, we should be able to go head-to-head with her.

312
00:20:15,260 --> 00:20:19,220
And when she runs out of that as well, it'll be time to use our ace in the hole.

313
00:20:19,220 --> 00:20:23,000
That's you, our arcane stage fighter!

314
00:20:24,380 --> 00:20:24,980
NERO!

315
00:20:32,980 --> 00:20:38,520
With NERO's arcane stage spells, and your combative spirit and fighting style.

316
00:20:38,520 --> 00:20:43,780
If we train hard and create a formidable team, I am confident with our abilities combined,

317
00:20:44,040 --> 00:20:48,440
we can overpower Banika and Magikula when the time finally comes to battle with them.

318
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:53,160
Well, Nero, can we count you in too?

319
00:20:55,340 --> 00:20:59,140
I'm about to seal away that devil's power you seem so proud of!

320
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:01,100
Mana method!

321
00:21:01,520 --> 00:21:02,400
Sealing magic!

322
00:21:02,400 --> 00:21:04,040
Eternal prison!

323
00:21:04,040 --> 00:21:14,460
I won't let Queen Laura Petschka or this world be harmed by scum like you!

324
00:21:14,460 --> 00:21:25,640
Beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful, beautiful

325
00:21:25,640 --> 00:21:35,440
夜明け前の空 静かにそっと

326
00:21:35,440 --> 00:21:42,480
ほら新たな日々が始まる

327
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:50,480
胸にしまい込んだままの想いを解き放って

328
00:21:50,480 --> 00:21:55,000
その翼を広げて

329
00:21:55,000 --> 00:21:57,160
One more time

330
00:21:57,160 --> 00:22:01,460
今飛び立て

331
00:22:01,460 --> 00:22:05,660
あの海原を見下ろして

332
00:22:05,660 --> 00:22:13,360
誰よりも遠く 何度でも Will you fly?

333
00:22:13,360 --> 00:22:23,460
Beautiful どんな景色も 君といれば輝くよ

334
00:22:23,460 --> 00:22:27,860
だからずっとそばにいて

335
00:22:27,860 --> 00:22:41,860
And never let go 僕のこの手を 離さないで どこまでも ついてきてほしい

336
00:22:41,860 --> 00:22:44,860
The world is so beautiful

337
00:22:57,860 --> 00:23:01,860
The previous queen's powers as well as their knowledge and experiences

338
00:23:01,860 --> 00:23:08,860
Here inside Laura Petchka's mind is where that colossal mountain of information materializes

339
00:23:08,860 --> 00:23:12,860
This isn't the right one

340
00:23:12,860 --> 00:23:14,860
Not in here

341
00:23:14,860 --> 00:23:17,860
Nope, no good

342
00:23:17,860 --> 00:23:18,860
No

343
00:23:18,860 --> 00:23:19,860
No!

344
00:23:19,860 --> 00:23:21,860
Oh, darn it!

345
00:23:21,860 --> 00:23:24,860
Why were the previous queens so disorganized, huh?

346
00:23:24,860 --> 00:23:29,860
They could've at least put things in ABC order!

347
00:23:29,860 --> 00:23:31,860
You're no better

348
00:23:35,860 --> 00:23:39,860
No matter how strong the enemy or how dire the situation

349
00:23:39,860 --> 00:23:40,860
We will never give up

350
00:23:40,860 --> 00:23:42,860
We'll keep pushing past our limits

351
00:23:42,860 --> 00:23:44,860
That's what the Black Fools do

352
00:23:44,860 --> 00:23:46,860
Black Clover, page 166

353
00:23:46,860 --> 00:23:48,860
Captain Yami Sukihiro

